			<div class="content" id="post-content-2373026">
									

<p>OK, I got the other four puzzles, but that one got me really stumped. I can't even seem to find what I'm supposed to do. Nice job, I think.</p>
<p>EDIT: Finally got it without help. Great one.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Spoilers!</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
