														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2545071">
									

<p>Thanks; I was trying to solve it on my own for a long while, figured out that common/unique letters were significant but not how, then came here looking for clues that didn't spoil it outright, and yours helped push me in the right direction (although it still took a lot of trial and error). Honestly, this puzzle kind of feels frustratingly unfair; it's too much at the border between regularity and irregularity, logic and abstraction, and identifying those particular groupings as critical still strikes me as a bit too wide a leap of logic to be fairly gleaned from the clues provided. A clever idea, and still a cool part of this amazing puzzle SCP, but it just needed either one more clue or a somewhat different execution to be great.</p>

							</div>

								
					
